IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-TOTIENT-VALVE-ACID.

DATA DIVISION.
01 D0-SUBSTRATE-TRUNK.
   05 D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME     PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
   05 D0-K-EXPONENT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
   05 D0-FAULT-FLAG        PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 D1-TOTIENT-SHADOW.
   05 D1-INITIAL-TOTIENT   PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
   05 D1-SHADOW-SNAPSHOT   PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.
   05 D1-VALVE-CHARGE-MU   PIC 9(9) USAGE R5.
   05 D1-VALVE-EXPONENT-E  PIC 9(9) USAGE R6.
01 D2-VALVE-STAGE.
   05 D2-STAGED-FLOW       PIC 9(9) USAGE R7.
   05 D2-COMMITTED-TOTIENT PIC 9(9) USAGE R8.
01 D3-LEAF-EVAL.
   05 D3-PROOF-RULING      PIC 9(9) USAGE R9.
   05 D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD     PIC 9(9) USAGE R10.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 953467954 TO D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME.
    MOVE 3 TO D0-K-EXPONENT.
    MOVE 0 TO D1-INITIAL-TOTIENT.
    MOVE 1000000 TO D1-VALVE-CHARGE-MU.
    MOVE 991220 TO D1-VALVE-EXPONENT-E.
    MOVE 0 TO D0-FAULT-FLAG.

    PERFORM STAGE-VALVE-FLOW.
    PERFORM COMMIT-OR-ROLLBACK-VALVE.
    PERFORM SYNC-DISPLACEMENT-MODULO.

    IF D1-INITIAL-TOTIENT == 0 AND D2-COMMITTED-TOTIENT == 0
        MOVE 0 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 4
    ELSE
        MOVE 4 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 1
    END-IF.

    EVAL.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

STAGE-VALVE-FLOW.
    comment Capture shadow snapshot of baseline 0 totient;
    MOVE D1-INITIAL-TOTIENT TO D1-SHADOW-SNAPSHOT.
    comment Accumulator Valve Gating: Flow = Modpow(mu, e, mu) = mu mod mu = 0;
    COMPUTE D2-STAGED-FLOW = D1-VALVE-CHARGE-MU - ((D1-VALVE-CHARGE-MU / D1-VALVE-CHARGE-MU) * D1-VALVE-CHARGE-MU).
    EXIT.

COMMIT-OR-ROLLBACK-VALVE.
    IF D0-FAULT-FLAG == 1
        MOVE D1-SHADOW-SNAPSHOT TO D2-COMMITTED-TOTIENT
    ELSE
        MOVE D2-STAGED-FLOW TO D2-COMMITTED-TOTIENT
    END-IF.
    EXIT.

SYNC-DISPLACEMENT-MODULO.
    COMPUTE D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD = D2-COMMITTED-TOTIENT - ((D2-COMMITTED-TOTIENT / 256) * 256).
    EXIT.

END-STRATEGY.
